      496.9,
      286.65,
      557.6
    ],
    "text": "Following allotment depicted in the Paper No. 12 of Final Village Plan 184 prepared by Survey Superintendent of Matare District situated in the village of Wepathaira South in Kandabada Pattu Minor Division in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Hakmana, Matara District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
