  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      652.63,
      286.56,
      739.28
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Hakmana on the 27th day of February, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th day of February, 2017 the nature of their",
